Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How to forget that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am. But I am not sure how much I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can you say to this day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.12,0:00:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what can you say to this day?\NI am not sure how to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.74,0:01:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we got into this amazing\Nbattle against Venom Myotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raymon and Garurumon digivolved\Nto Mega for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even that couldn't stop him. Finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we combined all our powers and that totally\Nblasted Venom Myotismon into Digidust.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, the digital\Nworld appeared in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.46,0:01:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What Izzy figured is that while\Nwe've been back here on Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.54,0:01:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things have gotten much\Nworse on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:02:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now we're going back\Nto fix the problems there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a bummer to have to\Nleave our parents so soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.32,0:02:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but saving two worlds is kinda important.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.60,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,330,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}The Four Kings of the Evil Mountain!\N\NDark Masters
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.42,0:02:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mano Yama no Shitenu, Dark Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.14,0:02:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those fit players are\Nfrozen with stage fright,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hopelessly waiting for the\Nmoment they'll be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet there's an\Nunseen twist in the plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we cut to the punchline\Nand go straight for the action.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, that would be boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to play this drama to the hilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.52,0:02:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's pull out all the stops and\Ngive them what they paid for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in complete agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A quick victory would be let down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digidestined will be\Non Spiral Mountain soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must rehearse before they get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be their final performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:03:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Sea Deramon, Puppet\NMon, and Machine Deramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I present to you the\Ndownfall of the Digidestined!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like we're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back where?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.36,0:03:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.64,0:03:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could that be Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.48,0:03:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's merely speculation, but it\Nseems to be a reasonable facsimile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We see Earth from here, like we\Nsaw the digital world from Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.68,0:03:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jo, I've been snoozing over here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.98,0:03:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we'll just save the\Nworld without you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon, Digiball, too! Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tanemon, Digiball, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.72,0:04:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.63,0:04:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Musumon, Digiball, too! Dunjumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nucumon, Digiball, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yokomon, Digiball, too! Biyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're among friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.66,0:04:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness! It's Chuumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.36,0:04:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What he needs is a complete makeover.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi? Palmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something bad happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sukamon and Chuumon\Nused to be inseparable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you came back to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.76,0:04:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would somebody mind helping me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoops, I forgot all about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh! You forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.34,0:05:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hanging here by my elbows\Nand you're off in La La Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, I wonder what it's\Nlike to have elbows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe! Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit fooling around!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just help me, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.06,0:05:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's gone wacko.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to get a hold of Gennai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not playing solitaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.00,0:05:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chumon's a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever it was,\Nit wasn't very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chuumon? Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.68,0:05:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't dreaming it's really\Nyou after all. Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell Mimi all about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to your friend Sukamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.64,0:05:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.80,0:05:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.10,0:05:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you guys left Vile Island, Sukamon\Nand I went on with life as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, eating, eating, and more eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sukamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never saw him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A powerful evil force took over the land,\Ncausing all kinds of bad things to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it rebuilt the digital world,\Nso it would be easier to conquer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been hiding ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.44,0:06:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the digital world has\Ncompletely changed from what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it different?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.46,0:06:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's been\Ndiscombobulated and taken apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.02,0:06:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digital world has been\Nrelocated way up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called Spiral Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.88,0:06:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left here of\Nthe old world except some ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:06:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying it's all up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, color me cynical, but nothing\Nsurprises me about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did all the other Digimon go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they up there too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.45,0:07:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Leomon? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from what I've been told, they'll destroy\Nanything that tries to get in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who will? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Masters. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they couldn't be too much tougher than\Nanybody else we've wrestled with before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll beat the pants right off of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got rid of Myotismon, so\Nwe could get rid of them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as the eight of us are together,\Nwe'll keep those big bullies away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for\Nyou, Chosen Children!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.78,0:07:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's MetalSeadramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this guy is one real hard-nosed,\Nand I mean hard-nosed. Take my advice.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.69,0:07:55.37,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}MetalSeadramon{{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.69,0:07:55.37,Sign,,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.69,0:07:55.37,Sign,,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.69,0:07:55.37,Sign,,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Cyborg Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.69,0:07:55.37,Sign,,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.69,0:07:55.37,Sign,,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate Stream
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is one train that\Nyou would rather miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.56,0:08:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if that's the way you\Nwant it, we can play rough, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Agumon! Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, Digiball, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.70,0:08:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's our turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon, Digivolve, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tanjaman, Digiball too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.26,0:08:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomamon, Digivolve too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, Digivolve too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.16,0:08:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.44,0:08:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Balamon, Digivolve too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Balamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.11,0:08:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Balamon, Digivolve too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:09:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Balamon, Digivolve too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.94,0:09:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.58,0:09:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howling blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Electro-shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about torpedo spray?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning paw!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.74,0:09:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should know your powers\Naren't strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.18,0:09:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come he's beating us so badly? Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.18,0:09:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's because he's a Mega Digimon and even\Neight champions can't overtake one Mega.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's stronger than all of us combined.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.94,0:09:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we're lost without more power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever notice we're always at the\Nwrong place at just the wrong time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to take one nasty ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.94,0:10:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K., are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was broken,\Nbut I guess I must be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.90,0:10:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Poor Gatomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.54,0:11:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be prepared for another Mega Digimon.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.56,0:11:12.94,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Mugendramon{{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.56,0:11:12.94,Sign,,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.56,0:11:12.94,Sign,,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.56,0:11:12.94,Sign,,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Machine Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.56,0:11:12.94,Sign,,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.56,0:11:12.94,Sign,,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Mugen Cannon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's called Machinedramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This metallic mutant can blow out a\NDigimon just like a birthday candle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!\NDigimon! Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.64,0:11:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.14,0:11:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not in the jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uhuru man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.30,0:11:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megadramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.20,0:11:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon, Digimon 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.30,0:12:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.32,0:12:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garudamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.30,0:12:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, super-evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.20,0:12:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gwilymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zudomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.30,0:12:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angewomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, show them\Nwhat you're made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope they're made of\Nsomething strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.18,0:12:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angewomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sure a lot better\Nthan falling on our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, can't you two take\Na break for one minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.40,0:13:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.31,0:13:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all supposed to be on the same side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.02,0:13:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't control it. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our bodies are doing\Nthis all by themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All by themselves, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've always hated\Nany form of exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.29,0:13:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've become string puppets,\Nand someone's operating us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't we, little smarty-peak?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.90,0:13:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you? You want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about if I help you look up my\Nprofile on your special computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:13:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's also a Mega Digimon!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.78,0:14:11.12,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Pinocchimon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.78,0:14:11.12,Sign,,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.78,0:14:11.12,Sign,,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.78,0:14:11.12,Sign,,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Puppet Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.78,0:14:11.12,Sign,,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.78,0:14:11.12,Sign,,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Bullet Hammer
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puppetmon has a controlling\Npersonality and a rotten temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him mad and he'll\Nbop you with his hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have to hit something,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should bop yourself for how\Nyou look in that stupid helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.24,0:14:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.15,0:14:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to let you go for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise to destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puppet Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.36,0:14:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hello there, boys\Nand girls, and welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.78,0:14:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today, I'm going to tell\Nyou an amazing story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, there\Nwere eight Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.92,0:15:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They went with their Digimon\Ncompanions to try to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.32,0:15:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The children and their Digimon discovered\Nthat in order for them to do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they had to climb up to\Nthe top of Spiral Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to their dismay, the\NDark Masters defeated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.61,0:15:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, clowny, nobody's\Nlaughing at your story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.50,0:15:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I happen to mention the story is true?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give you\Na preview of the plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's Piemon!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.57,0:15:31.53,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Piemon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.57,0:15:31.53,Sign,,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.57,0:15:31.53,Sign,,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.57,0:15:31.53,Sign,,380,0,225,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Demon Man Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.57,0:15:31.53,Sign,,380,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.57,0:15:31.53,Sign,,380,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Trump Sword
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a Mega Phantom\NDigimon of the worst kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never know what he's\Ngonna look like next.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I think your plot\Nneeds a few rewrites.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.75,0:15:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, more Digibomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.82,0:16:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.96,0:16:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WarGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters, Digimon, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, drop Digiball too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon monsters, Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Garurumon! Jijiman? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him know we mean business, WarGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Garurumon, teach that joker\Na lesson he'll never forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silver Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.28,0:16:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice Wolf Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even two Mega Digimon\Ncouldn't put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention he's a fashion disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.86,0:17:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your two Megas are newly Digimon'd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you expect them to compete\Nagainst an experienced and might I boast?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Superior Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.14,0:17:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please permit me to\Npresent my fellow actors in
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this captivating and\Ncharming comedy of errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.46,0:17:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Seadramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Machine Dramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puppetmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.00,0:17:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thought you were through with me,\Nbut I wanted to have some more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And myself, Piemon. We'd like\Nto begin by asking for audience
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.40,0:18:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,volunteers who would like to\Nbe the first to be destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh come now don't tell me you\Nhave stage fright I didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even want to go to camp in\Nthe first place I just wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.68,0:18:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to go to the mall can't somebody\Nelse save the silly world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,besides me Mimi I want to be\Na normal kid and not have any
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,big responsibilities I mean\Ncome on is that too much to ask
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair. Your incessant\Nwhining is getting on my nerves,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will be the first one to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jumon, speak to me, you poor thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, it's time for me to be deleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.16,0:18:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chuumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, now that he's out of the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.60,0:18:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would like to be the next\None to make their grand exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.94,0:19:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piedmon, you're gonna be washed\Nup when we're through with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pit Bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Piximon, perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prodigious, you cleverly used\Na barrier to avoid detection.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.06,0:19:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you said it was possible to save the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,planet if the eight of\Nus were all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come it's not happening, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.58,0:19:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Piximon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.42,0:19:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, being\Ntogether is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something else that\Nyou need to do to beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we going to find\Nout if you won't help?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, enough riddles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is something you\Nwill discover on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.72,0:19:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meanwhile make a run for it and\Nclimb to the top of Spiral Mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you better move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.41,0:19:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all Mega Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:19:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I can't win,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I should be able to distract\Nthem long enough for you to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay with you. No, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we need you on Spiral Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.68,0:20:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you to beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,River of Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.16,0:20:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a very important\Ntask ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.56,0:20:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you succeed, no one will\Never be able to stop you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.84,0:20:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you will make me proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can such a powerless little Digimon\Neven think about defeating us, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just call me a crazy little Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's stronger than he looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's possible he can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Kari. My hopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.04,0:20:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will Piximon hold off the\NDark Masters long enough
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.04,0:20:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the Digidestined to\Nreach Spiral Mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch the next Digimon Digital Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.88,0:21:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your smile Your
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.02,0:22:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we are already in the dark masters\Nof the area of the dark masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.60,0:22:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are going to take a look at the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we are going to take\Na look at the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.67,0:22:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.92,0:22:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.96,0:22:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we get the power of the DGVN?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.02,0:22:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, the DGVN adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:22:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Metal Seadramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.92,0:23:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a part of the dream.
